        "summary": "After somehow defeating Dr. Robotnik’s evil fortress of pure kaizo chaos, Silver Sonic decides to take a well-deserved vacation on the Kirgony Isles, a tropical archipalego known for its peaceful nature, abandoned casino, and its ancient temples before Robotnik inevitably comes to try and take control of the islands to turn them into Eggman Land with the help of his trusty Death Egg.",
