      {
        "id": 300562,
        "name": "Crazy Pinball",
        "summary": "The Pinball fever of the 80's in your console!!!\n\nA new arcade machine store has opened in your neighborhood.\n\nThe best pinball players are crowding in front of the machines trying to get the best score possible!\n\nPlay any of the three new machines in the scene, from the simple but addictive \"Wild Saloon\" and \"Sport Bets\" to the biggest challenge known in pinball machines, \"Pink world\", not for the faint of heart!\n\nShare your records and compete against other players, your scores are saved for the posterity.\n\nWere you penalized in your youth for playing too hard? In Crazy Pinball the machines do not punish strong hits. No fear!\n\nAnd when you have achieved a record in the three pinball machines, try a hidden arcade classic, too good to be missed!",
